+- Moving a member (`POST /projects/{pid}/members/{uid}/move`, for team transfers)
+  removes them from the project in the path and adds them to `toProjectId` with
+  the same role. Only managers may move members, and only when they are managers
+  of both projects. Checks run in this order: the caller must be able to read the
+  source project (404), a manager of it (403), and it must not be archived (409);
+  `uid` must be a member of it (404); `toProjectId` must differ from it (400); the
+  target must be readable by the caller (404), the caller must be a manager of it
+  (403), and it must not be archived (409); `uid` must not already be a member of
+  it (409). The member's tasks in the source project are unassigned, because an
+  assignee must be a member of the task's project.
 
